\ Build-cost driver for the colliding `open` exports in lib/sqlite.1z and
\ lib/lua.1z. Per-module compiled word identity makes an AOT build compile
\ both modules' bodies instead of one bare-name winner. The driver is built
\ to measure build time and binary size; it is never part of a timed run.

sql: "sqlite" load ;
lua: "lua" load ;

":memory:" sql.open drop
lua.open drop
